ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lamp\AppData\Local\Temp\ccRyPrEq.s 			page 5


 135:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * divided into three parts according to the number of multiplications that has to be
 136:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * taken place between inputA samples and inputB samples. In the first part of the
 137:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * algorithm, the multiplications increase by one for every iteration.
 138:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * In the second part of the algorithm, srcBLen number of multiplications are done.
 139:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * In the third part of the algorithm, the multiplications decrease by one
 140:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * for every iteration.*/
 141:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****   /* The algorithm is implemented in three stages.
 142:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q31.c ****    * The loop counters of each stage is initiated here. */
